      "refersTo": "segment-toggle",
      "description": "Items / Points and the forecast question. The pressed segment takes accent blue.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-seg\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Unit of measure\"><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"true\">Items</button><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Points</button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-seg{display:inline-flex;border:1px solid var(--border,rgba(11,11,11,.10));border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--plane,#f3f3f0)}.ds-seg button{font:600 12.5px/1.2 system-ui,-apple-system,'Segoe UI',sans-serif;border:none;background:none;padding:6px 11px;color:var(--text-secondary,#52514e);cursor:pointer}.ds-seg button+button{border-left:1px solid var(--border,rgba(11,11,11,.10))}.ds-seg button[aria-pressed=true]{background:var(--accent-bg,#256abf);color:var(--on-accent,#fff)}.ds-seg button:not([aria-pressed=true]):hover{background:var(--surface-1,#fcfcfb);color:var(--text-primary,#0b0b0b)}.ds-seg button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--link,#256abf);outline-offset:-2px}"
