      "description": "Paper on plane, hairline, 12px corners; a question for a heading and a caption in secondary ink.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-card\"><div class=\"ds-card-hd\"><div><h2>Can we trust the forecast? <span class=\"ds-info\">i</span></h2><div class=\"ds-cap\">Committed against completed, sprint by sprint. Consistency matters more than volume.</div></div><button class=\"ds-icon-btn2\" title=\"Show as table\">&#9636;</button></div><div class=\"ds-card-body\">Average hit rate <b>83%</b>; completed output swings by <b>5 items</b> between the best and worst sprint.</div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-card{font:400 14px/1.5 system-ui,-apple-system,'Segoe UI',sans-serif;width:420px;background:var(--surface-1,#fcfcfb);border:1px solid var(--border,rgba(11,11,11,.10));border-radius:12px;padding:12px 14px 14px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(11,11,11,.05),0 6px 18px rgba(11,11,11,.05);color:var(--text-primary,#0b0b0b)}.ds-card-hd{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;margin-bottom:2px}.ds-card h2{margin:0;font-size:14px;font-weight:650;letter-spacing:-.005em}.ds-cap{font-size:12px;color:var(--text-secondary,#52514e);margin:2px 0 10px}.ds-card-body{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--text-secondary,#52514e)}.ds-card-body b{font-weight:650;color:var(--text-primary,#0b0b0b)}.ds-info{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:50%;border:1px solid var(--axis,#c3c2b7);color:var(--muted,#6f6d67);font-size:9.5px;font-weight:700;cursor:help}.ds-icon-btn2{font-size:12px;border:1px solid var(--border,rgba(11,11,11,.10));background:var(--surface-1,#fcfcfb);border-radius:7px;width:26px;height:26px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:var(--text-secondary,#52514e);padding:0;cursor:pointer;flex:none}.ds-icon-btn2:hover{background:var(--plane,#f3f3f0);color:var(--text-primary,#0b0b0b)}"
    },
